Subject: [PATCH] mt6885: video codec + MDP / ADSP power domains, vcodec clocks, clock flags, lpm unused-clock gating (WIP, 2026-10-26)

On top of 0001-0045. Supersedes the mt6885-lpm.c of 0045 (adds
unused-clock gating). See NOTES.md 'Video codec' and 'Suspend power / SPM'.
